The key fixes:
1. Restored the `if(mid==pos)` check (which was commented out, causing the `else if` to be invalid syntax).
2. Changed `else if(mid>=pos)` to `else if(mid > pos)` since the `mid==pos` case is now handled separately.
3. When mid==pos is found, multiply by factorial of remaining elements.

